---
import DagGraphPrototype from '@components/explainer-prototype/DagGraphPrototype';
---

<section class="drawingSystem" id="drawing-system">
  <div class="rule"><span>04 / DRAWING SYSTEM</span></div>
  <header>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">DISCIPLINED HAND DRAFTING</p>
      <h2>Precise enough to explain. Human enough to think with.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="principles">
      <p>
        The interface remains exact. Hand-drawn geometry appears where the work is exploratory:
        models, equations, hypotheses, causal arrows, and marginal notes.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>variation is local, never global noise;</li>
        <li>most strokes are confident and smooth;</li>
        <li>corrections and open contours are rare;</li>
        <li>the same model can animate without changing its visual identity.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="specimenGrid">
    <article class="fieldCard">
      <div class="hatchedStrip">FIELD NOTE / RESILIENCE</div>
      <div class="cardBody">
        <span>OBSERVATION / 04.1</span>
        <h3>Redundancy is not the same as resilience.</h3>
        <p>
          A network may have many connections and still depend on a small number of structural
          bridges.
        </p>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Nodes</dt><dd>09</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Edges</dt><dd>15</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Bridges</dt><dd>02</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
      <aside>
        test the bridge first—
        <svg viewBox="0 0 120 55" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M112 9C78 7 63 17 51 31C40 44 26 47 8 44"></path>
          <path d="M17 37L8 44L18 49"></path>
        </svg>
      </aside>
    </article>

    <article class="mathCard">
      <span>WORKING MATH / 04.2</span>
      <p>λ₂(L) &gt; 0</p>
      <strong>⇒</strong>
      <p>one connected component</p>
      <small>but how quickly does cooperation recover after the cut?</small>
    </article>
  </div>

  <DagGraphPrototype
    client:visible
    embedded
    figureLabel="FIG. 02 / CANONICAL GRAPH GRAMMAR"
    timeSliceLabel="INTERACTIVE / ANIMATION-READY"
  />
  <p class="strokeLabLink">
    <a href="/brand/prototype/stroke-lab">Open the diagram stroke lab →</a>
    <span>Compare curve geometry, ink recipes, seeds, and open arrowheads.</span>
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .drawingSystem {
    padding-block: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem);
  }

  .strokeLabLink {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 22%, transparent);
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
    font:
      0.65rem/1.5 'IBM Plex Mono',
      monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .strokeLabLink a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2rem;
  }

  .strokeLabLink span {
    color: var(--graphite);
    text-align: right;
  }

  .rule {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 0.63rem;
  }

  .rule span {
    position: relative;
    top: -0.65em;
    padding-right: 1rem;
    background: var(--paper);
  }

  header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(18rem, 0.7fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6rem);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 14ch;
    margin: 0;
    font:
      500 clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 5.2rem)/0.95 'Space Grotesk',
      sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .principles {
    align-self: end;
    color: var(--graphite);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .principles ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
  }

  .specimenGrid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 0.7fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }

  .fieldCard {
    position: relative;
    border: 1px solid var(--ink);
  }

  .hatchedStrip {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 0.7rem;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 0 7px, var(--line) 7px 8px);
    font-size: 0.6rem;
  }

  .cardBody {
    padding: 1.4rem;
  }

  .cardBody > span,
  .mathCard > span {
    font:
      0.58rem/1 'IBM Plex Mono',
      monospace;
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
  }

  h3 {
    max-width: 20ch;
    margin: 0.8rem 0;
    font:
      500 clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.6rem)/1 'Space Grotesk',
      sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .cardBody > p {
    max-width: 55ch;
    color: var(--graphite);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  dl {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
  }

  dt {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  dd {
    margin: 0;
    font:
      1.2rem 'Kalam',
      cursive;
  }

  aside {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.4rem;
    bottom: 1.2rem;
    width: 175px;
    color: var(--graphite);
    font:
      1rem 'Kalam',
      cursive;
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  }

  aside svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  aside path,
  .notes path {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--graphite);
    stroke-width: 0.8;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .mathCard {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-content: center;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .mathCard > span,
  .mathCard small {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .mathCard p,
  .mathCard strong,
  .mathCard small {
    font-family: 'Kalam', cursive;
  }

  .mathCard p {
    align-self: center;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2vw, 1.8rem);
  }

  .mathCard strong {
    align-self: center;
    font-size: 2rem;
  }

  .mathCard small {
    color: var(--graphite);
    font-size: 1rem;
    transform: rotate(-1deg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    header,
    .specimenGrid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    aside {
      position: static;
      margin: 0 1.4rem 1.2rem auto;
    }

    .mathCard {
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
